                /// When SPI_MEM_WAITI_ADDR_EN is set, the cycle length of sent out address is (SPI_MEM_WAITI_ADDR_CYCLELEN\[1:0\] + 1) SPI bus clock cycles. It is not active when SPI_MEM_WAITI_ADDR_EN is cleared.
